# Cloudflare Workers static-assets redirects. Copied into dist/ at build.
# Syntax: <source> <destination> <status>
#
# This is NOT an SPA fallback — that stays wrangler.jsonc's not_found_handling.
# Astro's own `redirects` config can't be used here: under output: 'static' it
# emits a meta-refresh HTML page, which is a 200, not a 301.
#
# /schedule/ was the Car Week schedule until Car Week became a section of the
# site. Keep this rule indefinitely — the old URL predates launch but may be
# linked or indexed.
/schedule/ /monterey-car-week/schedule/ 301
/schedule /monterey-car-week/schedule/ 301
